flowchart TB
    users[Enterprise Users] --> agent[Enterprise KPI Agent]

    subgraph control[Request and Control Plane]
        agent --> context[User / Identity Context]
        context --> intent[Intent Resolution]
        intent --> candidates[KPI Candidate Resolution]
        candidates --> entitlement[Authorization / Entitlement Filter]
        entitlement --> certification[Effective CERTIFIED Version Filter; excludes DRAFT, UNDER_REVIEW, DEPRECATED, and ineffective versions]
        certification --> ambiguity{Ambiguity Control}
        ambiguity -->|Zero authoritative candidates| notfound[Not Found / Clarify]
        ambiguity -->|One authoritative candidate| routing[Domain / Tool Routing]
        ambiguity -->|Multiple legitimate authoritative candidates| clarify[Clarify; no analytical execution]
    end

    routing -->|Quantitative request| analyst[Cortex Analyst]
    routing -->|Definition / rationale request| search[Cortex Search]

    subgraph data[Quantitative Trust and Data Flow]
        raw[Raw / Source Data in Snowflake]
        staging[dbt Staging]
        intermediate[dbt Intermediate]
        salesProduct[Sales Mart]
        financeProduct[Finance Mart]
        salesView[Bounded Sales Semantic View]
        financeView[Bounded Finance Semantic View]

        raw --> staging --> intermediate
        intermediate --> salesProduct --> salesView
        intermediate --> financeProduct --> financeView
    end

    salesView --> analyst
    financeView --> analyst
    analyst -->|Governed quantitative result| agent

    registry[Certified KPI Registry]
    definitions[Governed KPI Definitions and Decision Provenance]
    knowledge[Governed KPI Knowledge]

    registry -. authoritative candidate metadata .-> candidates
    registry -. status and effective version .-> certification
    registry -. governs / certifies .-> salesView
    registry -. governs / certifies .-> financeView
    definitions -. governance content .-> registry
    definitions --> knowledge --> search
    search -->|Governed knowledge result| agent

    subgraph cross[Cross-cutting Controls]
        security[Security]
        governance[Governance]
        provenance[Lineage and Decision Provenance]
        observability[Observability]
        evaluation[Evaluation]
        finops[FinOps]
    end

    cross -. governs .-> control
    cross -. governs .-> data
    cross -. governs .-> registry

    airflow[Airflow] -. scheduled orchestration .-> raw
    cicd[Git / Codex / CI-CD] -. controlled delivery .-> control
    cicd -. controlled delivery .-> data
    cicd -. controlled delivery .-> registry
